From 49345a5b621c30e1899c0825cbc0b7c340338fb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 04:01:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): move into a project whose folder the gateway
 knows under another name [daveey]

Moving a hub session into the Mac's 'infra' project (~/code/focus) failed with
'folder already belongs to project focus': the hub has that folder as project
'focus', the same-name lookup missed it, and projects.create refused the
duplicate. Reuse the project that owns the folder instead.
